// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  File name:   CGVProgBump_DiffPass_EnvCM.crycg
//  Version:     v1.00
//  Created:     11/2/2004 by Andrey Honich.
//  Compilers:   CG/HLSL
//  Description: 
